Dear {{recipient_name}},

We keep in touch when attendance drops, because catching it early is usually the difference between a learner finishing the course and not.

{{first_name}}'s attendance on {{course_title}} is currently {{attendance_pct}}%, against the {{attendance_target}}% we ask for. The sessions missed since {{since_date}} are:

{{missed_sessions}}

If something is making it hard to attend — travel, work, health, caring responsibilities — please tell {{tutor_name}}. Support is available and it is easier to arrange now than after a deadline has passed.

{{tutor_name}}
Personal Tutor, {{college_name}}
